 · Book club 
 · Training Events for both personal and professional development are held regularly 
 · Monthly activites that vary (Past events have included deep sea fishing, paintball, kite flying, the electric run) 
 · Develop Leadership from within through a mentor program 
 · Go to a ton of events for company and personal development.
